    "type": "question",
    "label": "21",
    "prompt": "A sector has arc length $\\dfrac{8\\pi}{3}\\text{ cm}$ and area $\\dfrac{32\\pi}{3}\\text{ cm}^2$. Find the radius $r$ and the angle $\\theta$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$r=8\\text{ cm}$, $\\theta=\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}$ radians.",
      "worked": "Using $l=r\\theta$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\theta&=\\frac{8\\pi}{3r}.\\end{align*}$$\nSubstitute into $A=\\tfrac12r^2\\theta$:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{32\\pi}{3}&=\\frac12r^2\\left(\\frac{8\\pi}{3r}\\right)\\\\\\frac{32\\pi}{3}&=\\frac{4\\pi r}{3}\\\\r&=8\\text{ cm}.\\end{align*}$$\nHence,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\theta&=\\frac{8\\pi}{3\\times8}\\\\\\theta&=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\text{ radians}.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 64
  },
